<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Has the Two-Decade-Old Prophecy Come True?
<br class="ltx_break">Artificial Bad Intelligence Triggered 
<br class="ltx_break">by Merely a Single-Bit Flip in Large Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Yu Yan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
